/* ---- v2.11 · dollar basis at Ziraat's selling rate ----
   For every item and for the fund: how many dollars the money spent would have bought at Ziraat's selling rate on the day it was spent,
   how many dollars its value buys at today's Ziraat selling rate, and the difference. A USD deposit therefore earns exactly its net interest
   in dollars; a TRY share earns its TRY return minus the dollar's rise; a currency conversion shows what the bank's rate and KMV cost. */
